{"text": " A k\u00fd je ten najlep\u0161\u00ed cv\u00fdk na bo\u010dnej r\u00e1men\u00e1 pod\u013ea Jeffa Niparda? What are the best and worst side Delt exercises. Standing dumbbell lateral raise. I don't love that you guys zero tension in a stretch. I'll go... \u00dap\u00e1\u0161ky z jedn\u00fa ru\u010fka mi bol. Ty preto\u017ee sa ti nie p\u00e1\u010di, \u017ee tam je nulove napitev na t\u011bhn\u00fa tej pozic\u00ed. Jeff, Jeff, Jeff. H\u00e1no, je to pravda, \u017ee v tejto spodnej pozic\u00ed nie je\u017eiadn\u00e9 napitev a t\u00fato \u00faplneho reprity 90\u00b0 je maxim\u00e1lne napitev. Preto\u017ee gravit\u00e1cia, hej to ne treba vysvetlova\u0165. Je to ale v pr\u00edpade r\u00e1mien probl\u00e9m? V\u00f4bec nie, pre\u010do? Tak za prve r\u00e1men\u00e1 nebenefituj\u00fa z natihnutia z prostredkovan\u00e9 hipertrofi. Tak\u00fdch svaloch to je potrebn\u00e9, aby bolo nap\u00e4\u0165i aj v tej natihnutie pozic\u00ed. Pri t\u00fdch svaloch to rebenefituj\u00fa z natihnutia z prostredkovan\u00e9 hipertrofi. Tak\u017ee to, \u017ee je nap\u00e4\u0165i iba vo vrchn\u00e9 pozic\u00ed a na spodn\u00e9 pozic\u00ed nie je \u017eaden nap\u00e4\u0165i, nie je \u017eaden probl\u00e9m. Za druh\u00e9 r\u00e1men\u00e1 ni tak ve\u013emi nevie\u0161 natihnuti. O tejto pozic\u00ed, ktor\u00e9 movad\u00ed, \u017ee nie je nap\u00e4\u0165i, nie je natihnuta pozicia. Toto je anatomick\u00e1 pozicia r\u00e1mien. Mysl\u00edte si, \u017ee ke\u010f ma\u0161 r\u00e1men\u00e1 v tejto pozic\u00ed, tak ich ma\u0161 natihnut\u00e9, s\u00fa pod pas\u00edvnym nap\u00e4\u0165\u00edm? Ja si to nemysl\u00edm. Jedin\u00e9 negat\u00edvum, ktor\u00e9 ja vn\u00edm\u00e1m pri upa\u017eovan\u00ed s jednor\u00fa\u010dkami je, ako sme uyspominuli, na spodku je minim\u00e1lne nap\u00e4\u0165i, alebo \u017eiadne a na brchu je maxim\u00e1lne nap\u00e4\u0165i. V losetku, \u010deho je to najm\u00e4 \u00fa za\u010deto\u010dn\u00edkov alebo menej sk\u00fasen\u00fdch cvi\u010dencov, n\u00e1ro\u010dne odhadnut, ktor\u00fd dosihne zlihanie. To pr\u00e1ve preto, \u017ee ke\u010f u\u017e dosihnu zlihania a u\u017e sa neml\u00e1cu dos\u0165 do tohto bodu, ktor\u00fd je v tomto pr\u00edpadne najd\u00f4lej\u0161tej\u0161\u00ed, preto\u017ee tam je najv\u00e4\u010d\u0161ie nap\u00e4\u0165i. Tak robia e\u0161te tento rossach pohybu a myslia si, \u017ee robia dobre a ty opakovania r\u00e1taj\u00fa, no je to zbyto\u010dn\u00e9, preto\u017ee tu naozaj nie je \u017eiadne nap\u00e4\u0165i a t\u00fdm p\u00e1dom si k\u00e1sia trekovanie progres\u00edvneho preta\u017eovanie. Preto moje odpor\u00fa\u010danie je spr\u00e1v si nejak\u00fa pomyseln\u00fa hranicu, dajme tomu, \u017ee to bude 90\u00b0 \u00farove\u0148 r\u00e1mien, ktor\u00fd ke\u010f u\u017e nevl\u00e1ze\u0161 dosihnu\u0165, tak mus\u00ed dosihneho zlihania a seriu skon\u010d\u00ed\u0161. Tak\u017ee za m\u0148a bud\u00fa \u00fapa\u0161ky s jednor\u00fa\u010dkami k\u013eudne a t\u00fdr, a ke\u010f dodr\u017e\u00ed\u0161 odpor\u00fa\u010den\u00e9, ktor\u00e9 som ti d\u00e1l, tak mo\u017eno sa dostanie najd\u00f4lejska.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.84, "text": " A k\u00fd je ten najlep\u0161\u00ed cv\u00fdk na bo\u010dnej r\u00e1men\u00e1 pod\u013ea Jeffa Niparda?", "tokens": [50364, 316, 350, 11822, 1506, 2064, 41903, 79, 48651, 269, 85, 11822, 74, 1667, 748, 10236, 11794, 367, 842, 2558, 842, 2497, 46634, 64, 7506, 64, 426, 647, 19218, 30, 50556], "temperature": 0.6000000000000001, "avg_logprob": -0.5842640516493055, "compression_ratio": 1.452020202020202, "no_speech_prob": 0.05497759208083153}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 3.84, "end": 6.54, "text": " What are the best and worst side Delt exercises.", "tokens": [50556, 708, 366, 264, 1151, 293, 5855, 1252, 413, 2018, 11900, 13, 50691], "temperature": 0.6000000000000001, "avg_logprob": -0.5842640516493055, "compression_ratio": 1.452020202020202, "no_speech_prob": 0.05497759208083153}, {"id": 2, "seek": 0, "start": 6.54, "end": 7.82, "text": " St